    # tm "Three coffees today? You must be really dragging."
    tm "Tre caffè oggi? Devi essere davvero a pezzi."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills0.rpy:47
translate italian mills0_7c4237b9:

    # pc "One's for my boss and one for a co-worker."
    pc "Uno è per il mio capo e uno per un collega."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills0.rpy:48
translate italian mills0_d042a70f:

    # pc "I work over at the law offices across the street."
    pc "Lavoro negli studi legali dall’altra parte della strada."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills0.rpy:49
translate italian mills0_fcab54af:

    # tm "Oh yeah? You like it?"
    tm "Ah sì? Ti piace?"

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills0.rpy:50
translate italian mills0_0bffb200:

    # pc "It's not awful."
    pc "Non è male."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills0.rpy:51
translate italian mills0_cdb61927:

    # tm "I bet it pays better than this shithole."
    tm "Scommetto che pagano meglio di questo posto di merda."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills0.rpy:52
translate italian mills0_a8c4ebf9:

    # pc "Maybe? I'm just an assistant to Mrs. Mills over there."
    pc "Forse? Sono solo l’assistente della signora Mills laggiù."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills0.rpy:54
translate italian mills0_2b4c91e1:

    # tm "You work for that bitch?"
    tm "Lavori per quella stronza?"

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills0.rpy:55
translate italian mills0_969673ed:

    # "I am a little stunned at the amount of venom that she loads the sentence with."
    "Sono un po’ sbalordita dalla quantità di veleno con cui carica quella frase."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills0.rpy:56
translate italian mills0_22cb75fb:

    # pc "She's really not that bad."
    pc "In realtà non è poi così male."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills0.rpy:57
translate italian mills0_dbed954b:

    # tm "I had a girlfriend that interviewed for her and the old lady just flat out told her that she's not interested in hiring a woman."
    tm "Avevo una ragazza che ha fatto un colloquio da lei e la vecchia le ha detto senza mezzi termini che non era interessata ad assumere una donna."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills0.rpy:58
translate italian mills0_d8d899a0:

    # tm "That a woman couldn't do what she needed an assistant to do."
    tm "Che una donna non potesse fare ciò che lei si aspettava da un’assistente."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills0.rpy:59
translate italian mills0_150baf52:

    # tm "That a woman wasn't strong enough to carry the paperwork and books and stuff."
    tm "Che una donna non fosse abbastanza forte per portare in giro le scartoffie, i libri contabili e roba del genere."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills0.rpy:60
translate italian mills0_b4678777:

    # tm "And then she practically tossed my friend out of the office."
    tm "E poi ha praticamente cacciato la mia amica fuori dall’ufficio."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills0.rpy:61
translate italian mills0_f5e1f993:

    # pc "That's weird."
    pc "È strano."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills0.rpy:62
translate italian mills0_4a631625:

    # tm "Yeah it is."
    tm "Sì, lo è."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills0.rpy:64
translate italian mills0_c600d14b:

    # tm "What do you do for her that a woman can't do, I wonder?"
    tm "Mi chiedo: cosa fai per lei che una donna non possa fare?"

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills0.rpy:65
translate italian mills0_4385024a:

    # pc "Nothing really. I just make phone calls, clean up the office, and type while she dictates."
    pc "Niente di che, in realtà. Faccio solo telefonate, pulisco l’ufficio e scrivo al computer mentre lei detta."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills0.rpy:66
translate italian mills0_4cf794b1:

    # tm "Hrm, well she wanted a guy for some reason."
    tm "Hmm, beh, per qualche motivo voleva un uomo."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills0.rpy:67
translate italian mills0_2b17c9bb:

    # tm "Anyways, I'll get the coffees ready."
    tm "Comunque, vado a preparare i caffè."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills0.rpy:68
translate italian mills0_a9a2d1b9:

    # pc "Thanks."
    pc "Grazie."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills0.rpy:70
translate italian mills0_88f20fe1:

    # "I give my order to the barista."
    "Faccio la mia ordinazione al barista."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills0.rpy:71
translate italian mills0_7353f6dc:

    # "She glances over at me a few times while she makes the coffees. I am pretty sure I recognize her from somewhere, but can't place it."
    "Mi lancia qualche sguardo mentre prepara i caffè. Sono abbastanza sicura di averla già vista da qualche parte, ma non riesco a ricordarmi dove."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills0.rpy:74
translate italian mills0_08c7e0a1:

    # "Once she made the coffees, I take them back over to the office."
    "Una volta preparati i caffè, li riporto in ufficio."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills0.rpy:78
translate italian mills0_706ebccd:

    # "I hand Dana hers."
    "Ne porgo uno a Dana."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills0.rpy:79
translate italian mills0_de56f313:

    # cw "Oh God, thank you so much, I needed this."
    cw "Oh Dio, grazie mille, ne avevo proprio bisogno."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills0.rpy:82
translate italian mills0_c5031deb:

    # "Then I take Mrs. Mills hers as well."
    "Poi ne porgo uno anche alla signora Mills."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills0.rpy:84
translate italian mills0_d41d8cd9:

    # voice 'voices/mills_thankyou2.mp3'
    voice 'voices/mills_thankyou2.mp3'

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills0.rpy:85
translate italian mills0_818c6ce6:

    # bs "Thank you, [pcname]."
    bs "Grazie, [pcname]."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills0.rpy:86
translate italian mills0_b4ece937:

    # bs "Now you can get to cleaning. I'm going to relax here for a few minutes."
    bs "Ora puoi metterti a pulire. Io mi rilasserò qui per qualche minuto."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills0.rpy:87
translate italian mills0_1ca80c77_2:

    # pc "Yes, ma'am."
    pc "Sì, signora."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills0.rpy:88
translate italian mills0_25119040:

    # "I wouldn't mind relaxing and drinking my coffee too, but I pick up the duster and get to work."
    "Non mi dispiacerebbe rilassarmi e bere il mio caffè anch’io, ma prendo lo spolverino e mi metto al lavoro."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills0.rpy:91
translate italian mills0_85cd7035:

    # "While I clean the office, I can't shake the feeling that her eyes are on me."
    "Mentre pulisco l’ufficio, non riesco a scrollarmi di dosso la sensazione che i suoi occhi siano puntati su di me."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills0.rpy:92
translate italian mills0_897769e5:

    # "That she is watching me."
    "Che mi stia osservando."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills0.rpy:93
translate italian mills0_531ca259:

    # "When I get the opportunity, I sneak a look over at her."
    "Quando ne ho l’occasione, le lancio uno sguardo di soppiatto."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills0.rpy:96
translate italian mills0_367f3b05:

    # "Sure enough, she is sitting in her chair, rotated towards me, staring directly at me."
    "E infatti, è seduta sulla sua sedia, girata verso di me, e mi fissa direttamente."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills0.rpy:97
translate italian mills0_1bdeed63:

    # "I continue working and try not to let it bother me."
    "Continuo a lavorare e cerco di non farmi infastidire."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills0.rpy:100
translate italian mills0_9f676768:

    # "It does bother me a little though."
    "Però mi infastidisce un po'."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills0.rpy:102
translate italian mills0_0c2c0972:

    # "Especially with what Tammy had told me."
    "Soprattutto dopo quello che mi aveva detto Tammy."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills0.rpy:103
translate italian mills0_b6d20688:

    # "Had Mrs. Mills just hired me for eye candy?"
    "La signora Mills mi aveva forse assunta solo per farmi da \"piacere per gli occhi\"?"

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills0.rpy:104
translate italian mills0_31f90d79:

    # "I brave a glance at her again."
    "Trovo il coraggio di lanciarle un'altra occhiata."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills0.rpy:107
translate italian mills0_e3be7f5c:

    # "She is still openly staring at me, like it doesn't even bother her if I catch her."
    "Mi sta ancora fissando apertamente, come se non le importasse nemmeno se la sorprendo."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills0.rpy:109
translate italian mills0_e184f093:

    # "Then she smiles."
    "Poi sorride."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills0.rpy:110
translate italian mills0_516a48ac:

    # bs "Yes, [pcname]? Is there a problem?"
    bs "Sì, [pcname]? C’è qualche problema?"

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills0.rpy:111
translate italian mills0_726bc933:

    # pc "No ma'am. Just, you're staring at me."
    pc "No, signora. È solo che mi sta fissando."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills0.rpy:112
translate italian mills0_c0bf0f06:

    # bs "That's true."
    bs "È vero."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills0.rpy:113
translate italian mills0_5685fff8:

    # pc "Why?"
    pc "Perché?"

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills0.rpy:114
translate italian mills0_4f2fd266:

    # bs "You're a good looking guy. You know that right?"
    bs "Lei è un bel ragazzo. Lo sa, vero?"

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills0.rpy:115
translate italian mills0_3f8cb39e:

    # pc "What?"
    pc "Cosa?"

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills0.rpy:116
translate italian mills0_464983bb:

    # bs "When I see a young, sexy, masculine man working for me, doing whatever I tell him to do, I get certain thoughts."
    bs "Quando vedo un uomo giovane, sexy e virile che lavora per me, che fa tutto quello che gli dico di fare, mi vengono in mente certi pensieri."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills0.rpy:117
translate italian mills0_59186732:

    # pc "What kind of thoughts?"
    pc "Che tipo di pensieri?"

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills0.rpy:118
translate italian mills0_ee9b49c6:

    # "She raises an eyebrow, and I can almost read her mind as she looks over my body."
    "Alza un sopracciglio, e riesco quasi a leggerle nel pensiero mentre mi scruta da capo a piedi."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills0.rpy:119
translate italian mills0_9453aa03:

    # "Then she seems to push all that out of her head and composes herself once again."
    "Poi sembra scacciare tutto dalla mente e si ricompone."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills0.rpy:122
translate italian mills0_3ac1f82c:

    # bs "Oh we don't need to get into that."
    bs "Oh, non c’è bisogno di approfondire."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills0.rpy:123
translate italian mills0_6b371173:

    # bs "Let's just say that when I see you working like that, it's hard to look away."
    bs "Diciamo solo che quando ti vedo lavorare così, è difficile distogliere lo sguardo."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills0.rpy:124
translate italian mills0_702cd0f9:

    # bs "I'll be good though."
    bs "Mi comporterò bene, però."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills0.rpy:125
translate italian mills0_9ae62538:

    # bs "There's plenty of work to be done. You get back to yours and I'll focus on mine."
    bs "C’è un sacco di lavoro da fare. Tu torna al tuo lavoro e io mi concentrerò sul mio."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills0.rpy:126
translate italian mills0_1ca80c77_3:

    # pc "Yes, ma'am."
    pc "Sì, signora."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills0.rpy:129
translate italian mills0_0fdc08b5:

    # "I go back to cleaning and she moves back over to the conference table and sinks herself back into her work."
    "Io torno a pulire e lei torna al tavolo delle riunioni e si rituffa nel suo lavoro."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills0.rpy:130
translate italian mills0_f1272a0e:

    # "We don't talk much more for the rest of the day, and when it is time, I leave."
    "Non parliamo più di molto per il resto della giornata e, quando è ora, me ne vado."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills0.rpy:133
translate italian mills0_9a521cc3:

    # "The whole situation makes me feel uncomfortable."
    "L’intera situazione mi mette a disagio."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills0.rpy:134
translate italian mills0_0ed7a337:

    # "Mrs. Mills isn't bad looking for a woman her age, but still, it is weird."
    "La signora Mills non è male come donna della sua età, ma comunque è strano."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills0.rpy:135
translate italian mills0_3829b6ab:

    # "I wonder what I would do if she tried to do anything sexual towards me."
    "Mi chiedo cosa farei se provasse a fare qualcosa di sessuale nei miei confronti."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills0.rpy:136
translate italian mills0_1a3d193d:

    # "Would I argue with it and risk losing my job? Would I report her for sexual harassment?"
    "Mi opporrei e rischierei di perdere il lavoro? La denuncierei per molestie sessuali?"

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills0.rpy:137
translate italian mills0_943c6ec5:

    # "Or would I go along with it?"
    "O mi lascerei andare?"

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills0.rpy:138
translate italian mills0_22eaca64:

    # "Would I fuck Mrs. Mills?"
    "Mi farei la signora Mills?"

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills0.rpy:139
translate italian mills0_421381fa:

    # "I don't really have an answer to that for now."
    "Per ora non ho davvero una risposta a questa domanda."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills0.rpy:140
translate italian mills0_99d09cb8:

    # "These thoughts race through my head as I drive away from the office."
    "Questi pensieri mi frullano in testa mentre mi allontano in auto dall’ufficio."

